<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When you face persecution,</l><l>Rejection and scorn,</l><l>Others hide, the way abandon,</l><l>It seems you are left all alone,</l><l>Do not be discouraged,</l><l>You never are alone—</l><l>Christ now lives in you as His sweet home.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
